	•	Section 3 Comments/Quotes: The primary GBM was compared with logistic regression, random forest, XGBoost, CatBoost, and LightGBM. Patients were divided into training and test cohorts in a 7:3 ratio, and ten-fold cross-validation was used within training to optimize hyperparameters. Feature selection used a two-stage automated process consisting of Pearson-correlation assessment followed by Random-Forest-based Recursive Feature Elimination, leaving 27 predictors. SHAP global and local analyses were used to interpret the selected GBM.

